{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Pizza Restaurant Together</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the flour-dusted shoes of a pizza shop owner in a charming town. Start small, crafting delicious pizzas from scratch, serving hungry customers, and managing every detail of your restaurant. From cooking to customer service and design upgrades, it's up to you to build the coziest, most appealing pizza place in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're taking orders solo or managing things alongside friends online, Pizza Restaurant Together delivers a cozy, satisfying blend of cooking, management, and strategy\u2014all set in a vibrant, cartoony 3D world.  <br>\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\ud83c\udf55 <strong>Cook Pizzas:</strong> Prepare various pizza recipes using fresh ingredients and customizable toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/527d619fc38ffc483eb4e5c4d452bee9.poster.avif?t=1754641506\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/527d619fc38ffc483eb4e5c4d452bee9.webm?t=1754641506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/527d619fc38ffc483eb4e5c4d452bee9.mp4?t=1754641506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Singleplayer &amp; Online Co-op:</strong> Play solo or manage the restaurant with friends online. <br>\u200e\u200e<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/759372f3b4b794c6583b393822e873d6.poster.avif?t=1754641506\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/759372f3b4b794c6583b393822e873d6.webm?t=1754641506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/759372f3b4b794c6583b393822e873d6.mp4?t=1754641506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e<br>\u200e\u200e\ud83c\udf5f Fry Fries: Deep-fry frozen french fries to a perfect golden crisp, ready to serve hot.<br>\u200e\u200e\u200e<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/203ffce4e4ebaa68624b0b60876acfec.poster.avif?t=1754641506\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/203ffce4e4ebaa68624b0b60876acfec.webm?t=1754641506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/203ffce4e4ebaa68624b0b60876acfec.mp4?t=1754641506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Customization: Upgrade your kitchen and restaurant visually by unlocking stylish new decorations, layouts, and furniture.<br>\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/a7a171164f9acef5faed7a4ab7f64cce.poster.avif?t=1754641506\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/a7a171164f9acef5faed7a4ab7f64cce.webm?t=1754641506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam